      <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;you-are-that-leonard-jacobson&#34;&gt;You are That Leonard Jacobson&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Source: &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.advaita.org.uk/discourses/teachers/youarethat_jacobson.htm&#34;&gt;TW&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Author: Leonard Jacobson&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/1890580031/fromtheunreat-20&#34;&gt;&lt;figure class=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;    &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.advaita.org.uk/images/journeynowshadow.jpg&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;img src=&#34;https://www.advaita.org.uk/images/journeynowshadow.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;book cover&#34; title=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&#xA;    &#xA;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Visit &lt;a href=&#34;http://www.leonardjacobson.com/&#34;&gt;Leonard &amp;rsquo;s website&lt;/a&gt;. His latest teachings are available on his blog - &lt;a href=&#34;http://www.leonardjacobson.com/blog/&#34;&gt;Living in the Present Moment&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Purchase Leonard&amp;rsquo;s latest book, &amp;lsquo;&lt;strong&gt;Journey Into Now: Clear Guidance On the Path of Spiritual Awakening&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;rsquo; from &lt;a href=&#34;http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/1890580031/fromtheunreat-20&#34;&gt;Amazon.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;or from &lt;a href=&#34;http://www.amazon.co.uk/exec/obidos/ASIN/1890580031/thespiritupat-21&#34;&gt;Amazon.UK&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;That which you seek, you already are. Just wake up and be that. Then you will be in the truth of life. You will be enlightened. You will be in Oneness and timelessness and so there is no soul, no journey, no separation, no seeking and no finding. Everything dissolves in the moment of NOW. Everything is revealed in Oneness.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
